WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.280
All right, suspects.

2
00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:03.680
Your character is waiting on your phone.

3
00:00:04.065 --> 00:00:06.960
Read your profile, open your private secrets,

4
00:00:07.025 --> 00:00:08.320
and check your missions.

5
00:00:08.705 --> 00:00:10.560
Your admission seal is public,

6
00:00:10.785 --> 00:00:14.080
so introduce its color and symbol along with your name.

7
00:00:14.385 --> 00:00:16.000
You can bluff about yourself.

8
00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:18.000
The evidence stays honest.

9
00:00:18.305 --> 00:00:19.760
Tap ready when you're set.
